            "surefold-bank:bank.app.AccessLogSpec.Ada's page lists Bob's look, and the topic carries it with the grant's approval id()",
            "surefold-bank:bank.app.AccessLogSpec.refusals are recorded for everyone, a customer's own looks are not, and only the auditor sees either()",
            "surefold-bank:bank.app.AccountPageSpec.an account opened on the page, withdrawn from with a lost answer, moves the money once()",
            "surefold-bank:bank.app.AccountPageSpec.an account that does not exist says so()",
            "surefold-bank:bank.app.AccountPageSpec.money moved without the page shows in its statement, with nothing clicked()",
            "surefold-bank:bank.app.AccountPageSpec.more than the balance is refused with the bank's own reason, and the statement shows what moved()",
            "surefold-bank:bank.app.ActAsSpec.a token acting as Ada with no grant behind it sees nothing of hers()",
            "surefold-bank:bank.app.ActAsSpec.stopping ends acting at once, and the grant cannot be used by someone else in support()",
            "surefold-bank:bank.app.ActAsSpec.support acts as Ada with a grant, sees her statement and the banner, is refused a withdrawal, and is back to themselves when it ends()",
            "surefold-bank:bank.app.ApiSpec.an account holds one currency, to its places, and its books balance apart from every other's()",
            "surefold-bank:bank.app.ApiSpec.an account is opened, paid into, refused, and paid out of over HTTP()",
            "surefold-bank:bank.app.CallerTableSpec.and the table covers every endpoint the document describes()",
            "surefold-bank:bank.app.CallerTableSpec.every endpoint answers every kind of caller as the table says()",
