            "surefold-bank:bank.app.DailyLimitApiSpec.a daily limit that is not an amount of the account's currency is refused at opening()",
            "surefold-bank:bank.app.DailyLimitApiSpec.withdrawals and transfers past an account's daily limit are refused, saying the limit and what is left()",
            "surefold-bank:bank.app.DbRolesSpec.as bank_reader with bank caller set to Ada, select star from statement_line returns only her rows()",
            "surefold-bank:bank.app.DbRolesSpec.the bank reads a statement through the same fence, so a read the rules let slip returns nothing()",
